      "Target": "天气更改"
    },
    "type/\"\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"changes\"/property/\"Description\"": {
      "Current": "sha256:6c14ae3f2414be0f70f300b1f4268b97aa8fd0344a6a379bf07b59d789a0dab9",
      "Target": "以原子方式应用的有序更改。每一项将序列向前推进一位；空列表是追赶式恢复，不会推进游标或充当周期性活动。"
    },
    "type/\"\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"changes\"/property/\"Name\"": {
      "Current": "sha256:905f6564cca806cb842a5b0eff75463695e35e6b2f7470657c6c68a0b62e88f9",
      "Target": "天气更改"
    },
    "type/\"\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"from_cursor\"/property/\"Description\"": {
      "Current": "sha256:ffdf1a02b4ad9d46519c5fdc0e22cb1388306ccaf45e2715299581a278a4bdfe",
      "Target": "此报告的排除式下界游标，也是客户端在应用报告之前必须已经持有的精确游标。"
    },
    "type/\"\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"from_cursor\"/property/\"Name\"": {
      "Current": "sha256:ffb780375d5c97a8e2b3acdcc7f2b29d04817be651368cd771dacd5375860a11",
      "Target": "起始游标"
    },
    "type/\"\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"through_cursor\"/property/\"Description\"": {
      "Current": "sha256:3637d9a17cad9988b5971405b62e17e95956cae29c5181e40d2c72d92e9bc862",
      "Target": "应用此报告中的每个更改后，到达包含的上部光标。它必须保留与 `from_cursor` 相同的纪元时间戳。服务器光标重置永远不会作为增量报告进行；它需要完全重置。"
    },
    "type/\"\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"through_cursor\"/property/\"Name\"": {
      "Current": "sha256:64f580896edbb0009ce83ae73e4e5a80f37659bb99384d3b7bc0b9390fffa311",
      "Target": "截止游标"
    },
    "type/\"\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/property/\"Description\"": {
      "Current": "sha256:be87c478abaafd48fd9de3742476f98d8bf54af88a58ba4ec78da8d7fc523b23",
      "Target": "携带有序的原子范围的天气变化。仅当客户端存储的游标等于 `from_cursor` 时，客户端才会应用报告，然后存储 `through_cursor`。空报告是追赶的恢复结果；周期性无变化活性使用 PeerAlive。"
    },
    "type/\"\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/\"SprinklerWeatherIncrementalReportV1\"/property/\"Name\"": {
